  "text": "AFK Chaos Elemental\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nAFK Method\nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nUseful Items and Unlocks\n⬥ High tier (T85+) weapons:  /  \n⬥ 25+ Prayer bonus. Dragon Rider armour is an easy way to achieve this\n⬥ Conservation of Energy  (only if  / )\n⬥ Demon Horn Necklace  and Bonecrusher  to upkeep prayer\n⬥ Zuk cape  /  /  /  (not needed for )\n⬥ Any cannon variant  \n⬥ Desolation / Anguish   is active (only if Ranged)\n⬥ Equilibrium aura  is a good choice due to its duration\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Magic preset \n⬥ Melee preset \n⬥ Ranged preset \n⬥ Necromancy preset \n\n​\nAction Bar\n⬥ Magic \n\n⬥ Melee  (115+ kph)\n\n⬥ Ranged \n\n⬥ Necromancy  (110+ kph)\n\n​\nPositioning\n⬥ Initially position yourself next to where Chaos Elemental spawns. Place your cannon on top of where Chaos Elemental spawns.\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Melee example \n⬥ Ranged example \n⬥ Necromancy example \n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Chaos Elemental ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ AFK Method Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Useful Items and Unlocks ⬥ High tier (T85+) weapons: / ⬥ 25+ Prayer bonus. Dragon Rider armour is an easy way to achieve this ⬥ Conservation of Energy (only if / ) ⬥ Demon Horn Necklace and Bonecrusher to upkeep prayer ⬥ Zuk cape / / / (not needed for ) ⬥ Any cannon variant ⬥ Desolation / Anguish is active (only if Ranged) ⬥ Equilibrium aura is a good choice due to its duration ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Magic preset ⬥ Melee preset ⬥ Ranged preset ⬥ Necromancy preset ​ Action Bar ⬥ Magic ⬥ Melee (115+ kph) ⬥ Ranged ⬥ Necromancy (110+ kph) ​ Positioning ⬥ Initially position yourself next to where Chaos Elemental spawns. Place your cannon on top of where Chaos Elemental spawns. ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee example ⬥ Ranged example ⬥ Necromancy example ​",
